.TH start-cli-setup-execute 1  "execute "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-setup\-execute \- Run the initial setup against an installed OS or fresh data drive
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli setup execute\fR <\fB\-\-guid\fR> [\fB\-\-kiosk\fR] [\fB\-\-hostname\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the initial setup against an installed OS or fresh data drive
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-guid\fR \fI<GUID>\fR
Disk GUID returned by setup install\-os, or an existing data drive
.TP
\fB\-\-kiosk\fR
Enable kiosk mode
.TP
\fB\-\-hostname\fR \fI<HOSTNAME>\fR
The server\*(Aqs .local hostname — up to 32 lowercase letters, numbers and hyphens, not starting or ending with a hyphen; defaults to a generated one
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
